\n</g>\n</svg></span> as though it were a constant and apply the addition and multiplication principles as usual.</p>\n<p>In this case, we simply divide both sides of the equation by <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.809ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 779 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">4\\mathbin{:}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-34\" d=\"M462 0Q444 3 333 3Q217 3 199 0H190V46H221Q241 46 248 46T265 48T279 53T286 61Q287 63 287 115V165H28V211L179 442Q332 674 334 675Q336 677 355 677H373L379 671V211H471V165H379V114Q379 73 379 66T385 54Q393 47 442 46H471V0H462ZM293 211V545L74 212L183 211H293Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-3A\" d=\"M78 370Q78 394 95 412T138 430Q162 430 180 414T199 371Q199 346 182 328T139 310T96 327T78 370ZM78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-34\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3A\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"10.454ex\" height=\"25.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -12.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -5814.5 4501.1 11126.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n\\eqalign{\n\\require{cancel}\n\t\t4x &amp;= y <span>\\</span>[5pt]\n\t\t\\dfrac {4x} {4} &amp;= \\dfrac y 4 <span>\\</span>[5pt]\n\t\t\\dfrac {{\\cancel{4}}x} {\\cancel{4}} &amp;= \\dfrac y 4 <span>\\</span>[5pt]\n\t\tx &amp;= \\dfrac y4\n\t}\n</title>\n<defs a